    "Add the green peas and cook until they are tender.",
    "Add the cooked basmati rice and stir well.",
    "Add the curry powder mixed with water and stir well.",
    "Add the melted render-fat and stir well.",
    "Add the crushed Rice Krispies and stir until the mixture is crumbly.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve hot."
